    "http://www.workingatmcmaster.ca/careers/": {
      "title": "Human Resources Services",
      "description": "Careers - Human Resources Skip to McMaster Navigation Skip to Site Navigation Skip to main content Popular Links About McMaster Home News Research & Innovation Giving to McMaster Working at McMaster Study Undergraduate Programs Graduate Programs Continuing Education Admission Requirements Visit Tours Campus Maps Campus Safety Services Events Connect University Directories Media Inquiries Research Centres & Institutes McMaster Global Alumni Search button Keyword Search Clear search Search Current Website Search McMaster Student Support Campus Safety Services Equity & Inclusion Office IT Support Office of the Registrar Ombuds Office School of Graduate Studies Student Wellness Centre Student Affairs Tools Academic Calendars Avenue to Learn Campus Maps Faculty and Staff Directory Find an Expert Microsoft Office 365 Mosaic Safety App Faculties DeGroote School of Business Engineering Health Sciences Humanities Science Social Sciences On Campus Athletics & Recreation Campus Store Housing & Conference Services Hospitality Services Libraries Student Success Centre McMaster McMaster Home Brighter World Daily News Teaching Excellence Faculty & Staff Directory Website Directory Discover McMaster Overview About the Campus Community Engagement Fast Facts Governance History of McMaster How to Get to McMaster Policies, Procedures & Guidelines President's Message Provost & Vice-President (Academic) Strategic Plan Teaching and Learning at McMaster Academics Overview Undergraduate Studies/Programs Graduate Studies/Programs Part-Time Studies & Continuing Education Departments & Faculties Alumni Alumni Home About the Alumni Association Events Listing Services & Benefits In-person Series Online Series Student Programs Mac10 Young Alumni Learn about Giving to McMaster Make a Gift Now Current Students Overview Student Affairs Chaplaincy Human Rights & Equity Information Technology Office of Academic Integrity Ombuds Parking & Transit Registrar Safety & Security Student Financial Aid & Scholarships Student Accounts Graduate Students Part-Time Students McMaster Student Union Clubs Events Future Students Overview Undergraduate Graduate Studies MBA Program Continuing Education Parents Student Services Virtual Tour Library Home Services Collections Spaces Research Help About the Library Library Catalogue Course Reserves My Library Account Research & Innovation Overview Canada Research Chairs Ethics in Human Research McMaster Experts McMaster Innovation Park Office of International Affairs Partnership Opportunities Research Centres & Institutes Research Policies & Procedures McMaster logo Human Resources Services Home About HR Team HR Strategic Plan Careers Work@McMaster Current Opportunities Career Framework Immigration Employees Employee Self Service Compensation, Benefits & Retirement Plans Health, Safety & Well-Being Employment Equity Labour Relations Learning & Development Life Events Payroll & Tax Awards & Recognition Community Engagement Managers Hiring & Recruitment Job Design & Evaluation Onboarding & Offboarding Employee Engagement Time Reporting & Payroll Mosaic HR and eForms Health, Safety, Well-being & Risk Management Coach Approach Retirees Pension Plans Group Registered Retirement Savings Plan Post-Retirement Benefits Supplemental Retiree Benefits MURA Retiree Forms Retiree FAQs Resources Frequently Used Forms Benefit Booklets Collective Agreements Employment Related Policies, Directives & Procedures Mosaic HR eForms Short-Term Employees (STE) Flexible Work Guidelines Careers At McMaster our people are our most valuable asset. We strive to attract, develop and retain the best staff, researchers and faculty members from around the world. Human Resources Careers Careers McMaster is committed to building a diverse and inclusive community in which every member is accepted, supported, safe, valued, and respected for their contributions to the shared purpose of the university. We offer employees a range of competitive benefits and perks, including comprehensive health and dental coverage, flexible work arrangements, retirement plans with employer matching, tuition assistance and bursary program, continuing education, leadership courses and more. Explore the possibility of working at McMaster and how you can help create a brighter world. Work at McMaster Learn More Learn More Current Opportunities Learn More Learn More Career Framework Learn More Learn More Immigration Learn More Learn More Building community and excellence: McMaster named a top regional employer For the 11th year in a row, McMaster University has been recognized as one of the region’s top workplaces in the 2026 Hamilton-Niagara Top Employers ranking. Learn more Human Resources Services Contact Us Call us: (905) 525-9140 ext. 222-HR Email us: hr.mcmaster@mcmaster.ca Leave Us Feedback Accessibility If you have an accommodation need for a planned meeting, event, or interview, please e-mail or call us to make the appropriate arrangements. If there is an AODA web accessibility issue with this website, please report it to Media Production Services using our AODA bug reporting form . This website is powered by MacSites 1280 Main Street West, Hamilton, Ontario L8S 4L8 © 2026 McMaster University Contact Terms & Conditions Privacy Policy"
    },
